  "job_B3.3.22_20251003_114708": {
    "chunk_text": "Sermo in festis sancte marie virginis. Se godspellere Lucas s\u00e6ig\u00f0 on \u00feyssen godspelle, \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend com into sumen c\u00e6stele, & sum wif Seo h\u00e6fde ane suster \u00fee w\u00e6s gen\u00e6md Maria. Seo w\u00e6s sittende \u00e6t ures Drihtenes foten, & hlyste his worden. Ac Martha beswanc & bestuddede \u00fea lichamlice behef\u00f0en. Seo stod & cw\u00e6\u00fe to \u00fean H\u00e6lende, La, Drihten, nis \u00fee na gemynde, \u00fe\u00e6t min suster l\u00e6tt me anen S\u00e6ge hire, \u00fe\u00e6t heo me fylste. Se H\u00e6lend hire andswerede & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Martha, Martha, \u00feu eart bisig & gedrefd on feale \u00feingan, ac Maria h\u00e6f\u00f0 gecoren \u00fe\u00e6t betste d\u00e6l, \u00fe\u00e6t hire n\u00e6fre ne by\u00f0 wi\u00f0togan. Sume ungel\u00e6rede m\u00e6nn wundrige\u00f0, hw\u00e6t \u00feiss godspell belimpe to \u00fe\u00e6re eadigen Marien Cristes \u00d0es c\u00e6stel, \u00fe\u00e6re ure Drihten in com, betacne\u00f0 rihtlice \u00fe\u00e6t synderlice unw\u00e6mme m\u00e6den Maria Cristes For c\u00e6stel is geclypod sum heh stepel, \u00fee by\u00f0 mid wealle betrymed, swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ig\u00f0er o\u00f0re bewere\u00f0 wi\u00f0 \u00d0yssen c\u00e6stele is rihtlice wi\u00f0meten \u00fe\u00e6t synderlice m\u00e6den Marie Cristes moder, for heo w\u00e6s f\u00e6stlice & for \u00fean \u00fee m\u00e6ge\u00f0had stranglice m\u00e6ig wi\u00f0standen \u00fe\u00e6re galnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t hit ne by\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t & for \u00fean \u00fee eadmodnysse wi\u00f0stant modignysse, \u00fe\u00e6t heo ne by\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t oferswi\u00f0en, galnysse & sw",
